 from the blood, forming a liquid called urine. The kidneys funnel the urine into the bladder along two separate tubes called ureters. The bladder stores the urine until muscular contractions force the urine out of the body through the urethra. Each day, your kidneys produce about 1.5 liters of urine. All of it needs to be removed from your system. This occurs through urination.\nIf your kidneys are diseased and not working properly, the buildup of waste in your system will eventually lead to death. Some kidney diseases can be treated with medication. Severe kidney diseases require more intense treatment.","tokens":[" kidneys"," filter"," the"," wastes"," from"," the"," blood",","," forming"," a"," liquid"," called"," urine","."," The"," kidneys"," funnel"," the"," urine"," into"," the"," bladder"," along"," two"," separate"," tubes"," called"," u","re","ters","."," The"," bladder"," stores"," the"," urine"," until"," muscular"," contract","ions"," force"," the"," urine"," out"," of"," the"," body"," through"," the"," u","reth","ra","."," Each"," day",","," your"," kidneys"," produce"," about"," 1",".","5"," lit","ers"," of"," urine","."," All"," of"," it"," needs"," to"," be"," removed"," from"," your"," system","."," This"," occurs"," through"," ur","ination",".","\n","If"," your"," kidneys"," are"," dise","ased"," and"," not"," working"," properly",","," the"," buildup"," of"," waste"," in"," your"," system"," will"," eventually"," lead"," to"," death","."," Some"," kidney"," diseases"," can"," be"," treated"," with"," medication","."," Se","vere"," kidney"," diseases"," require"," more"," intense"," treatment","."],"activations":[0.12524,0.16372,0.15347,0.1541,0.14713,0.11295,0.13438,0.11862,0.06469,0.05366,0.09949,0.09125,0.08586,0.08701,0.15404,0.0685,0.1053,0.14464,0.13508,0.01165,0.02957,0.00783,0.03208,0.02681,0.06008,0.10285,0.02958,0.01063,0.07659,0.02969,0.03896,0.06001,0.02924,0.14844,0.13855,0.12165,0.12253,0.04941,0.0837,0.15019,0.14543,0.07959,0.1699